subckt sar8_se_window PHASE_REQUEST SEL9 SEL7 SEL6 SEL5 SEL4 VDD VSS DELIVERED
// A transition propagates once per decision. Both polarities traverse real DEL cells.
// Taps by compared bit: 6:T11 5:T9 4:T7 3:T6 2:T5 1,0:T4. Each SELn rises once per
// conversion, on the commit before its first use, and only shortens the window.
XDEL1 (PHASE_REQUEST T1 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL2 (T1 T2 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL3 (T2 T3 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL4 (T3 T4 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL5 (T4 T5 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL6 (T5 T6 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL7 (T6 T7 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL8 (T7 T8 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL9 (T8 T9 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL10 (T9 T10 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XDEL11 (T10 T11 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XTAP9 (T11 T9 SEL9 W9 VDD VSS) MUX2D1BWP12T30P140
XTAP7 (W9 T7 SEL7 W7 VDD VSS) MUX2D1BWP12T30P140
XTAP6 (W7 T6 SEL6 W6 VDD VSS) MUX2D1BWP12T30P140
XTAP5 (W6 T5 SEL5 W5 VDD VSS) MUX2D1BWP12T30P140
XTAP4 (W5 T4 SEL4 DELIVERED VDD VSS) MUX2D1BWP12T30P140
// BEGIN SARADC RNL
