ends sar8_se_store

subckt sar8_se_ctrl CMP_CLK CODE0 CODE1 CODE2 CODE3 CODE4 CODE5 CODE6 CODE7 COMP_N COMP_P D0 D1 D2 D3 D4 D5 D6 D7 COMMIT SAMPLE VDD VSS ACTIVE
XTIM (ACTIVE SAMPLE SEL9 SEL7 SEL6 SEL5 SEL4 COMP_P COMP_N CMP_CLK COMMIT DATA VDD VSS) sar8_se_timing
XWORD (CODE0 CODE1 CODE2 CODE3 CODE4 CODE5 CODE6 CODE7 DATA DONE D0 D1 D2 D3 D4 D5 D6 D7 NEXT0 NEXT1 NEXT2 NEXT3 NEXT4 NEXT5 NEXT6 NEXT7 TRIAL6 TRIAL5 TRIAL4 TRIAL3 TRIAL2 VDD VSS) sar8_next_word
// Sticky tap selects: the commit of bit k sets the select for bit k-1 until the
// next accepted sample. Each feeds only the window multiplexers.
// The OR is INV+INV+ND2: a trial glitch while the select is already set must not lift a
// floating PMOS stack node above the rail (FF-cold terminal-voltage screen).
XSEL9_QB (SEL9 SEL9_QB VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XSEL9_TB (TRIAL6 SEL9_TB VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XSEL9_D (SEL9_QB SEL9_TB SEL9_D VDD VSS) ND2D1BWP12T30P140
XSEL9 (COMMIT SEL9_D SAMPLE VDD VSS SEL9) sar8_se_store
XSEL7_QB (SEL7 SEL7_QB VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
